---
permalink: manifest.webmanifest
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#-
  The web app manifest (02-§7.1–7.2, 03-§5.3). `start_url`, `scope` and `id` are the
  base path, so the QA site under /qa/ is a different app with its own cache
  (02-§7.9). The colours are read from tokens.css by the build (`theme`), never typed
  here. The `version` member is not part of the standard; it is there so that the
  installed app can be told apart from the deployed one (02-§10.26).
-#}
{%- set base = '/' | url %}
{
  "name": {{ site.name | dump | safe }},
  "short_name": "Stättared",
  "description": "Djuren och hagarna på Stättareds 4H-gård. Fungerar offline.",
  "lang": "sv",
  "dir": "ltr",
  "id": {{ base | dump | safe }},
  "start_url": {{ base | dump | safe }},
  "scope": {{ base | dump | safe }},
  "display": "standalone",
  "theme_color": {{ theme.themeColor | dump | safe }},
  "background_color": {{ theme.backgroundColor | dump | safe }},
  {%- if build.version %}
  "version": {{ build.version | dump | safe }},
  {%- endif %}
  "icons": [
    { "src": {{ '/assets/img/icon-192.png' | url | dump | safe }}, "sizes": "192x192", "type": "image/png" },
    { "src": {{ '/assets/img/icon-512.png' | url | dump | safe }}, "sizes": "512x512", "type": "image/png" },
    { "src": {{ '/assets/img/icon-maskable-512.png' | url | dump | safe }}, "sizes": "512x512", "type": "image/png", "purpose": "maskable" }
  ]
}
